# Frontend

## App Router

- Pages: `frontend/src/app/` — `/`, `/browse`, `/story/[slug]` (**`StoryDetailPanel`** client hydrate; **`generateMetadata`** + segment **`opengraph-image.tsx`**), `/blindspot`, `/bias`, `/rumors`, **`/verify`**, **`/verify/[slug]`**, **`/verify/database`**, **`/profile`** (**`MyNewsBiasDashboard`**), `/pro`, `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`, `/offline`, **`/admin`**, **`/admin/login`**, **`/admin/register`** (internal; `admin/layout.tsx` sets `robots: noindex`)
- Layout: `layout.tsx` — **`metadataBase`** from **`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`** / `VERCEL_URL`; default Open Graph + Twitter card; `ThemeProvider`, **`SiteHeader`** (wordmark + EN tagline, **`ThemeToggle`**, **`AuthNav`** — no Bangla date in header), `MobileNav`, `InstallPWA`; fonts Inter + Newsreader + Noto Sans Bengali
- Shared UI: `frontend/src/components/`
- Domain helpers: `frontend/src/lib/` (`api`, **`api-base`** (`PUBLIC_API_BASE`, **`SERVER_API_BASE`** / `API_URL` for SSR), **`api-resilience`**, **`anti-clickbait-summary`** (`buildAntiClickbaitBullets`, **`antiClickbaitText`**), **`article-image-url`**, **`chunk-load-error`**, **`feed-etag`**, **`client-story-cache`** (localStorage **`shorup:top-stories:v5`**, migrates v2), **`client-story-hydrate`** (**`hydrateClientStory`** / **`hydrateClientStories`**), **`mixed-script-text`** (**`normalizeMixedScriptHeadline`**, **`pickPrimaryBengaliHeadline`**, **`storySubtitle`** — hides the Latin story title once Bangla exists; loanword repair for glued BN+Latin), **`reading-history`** (**`recordStoryRead`**, **`recordArticleClick`**, **`computeMyNewsBiasStats`**, localStorage **`shorup_reading_history_v1`**), **`track-article-clicks-pref`**, **`followed-stories`** (v2 records + legacy slug migrate), **`followed-topics`**, **`follow-people`** (**`BD_FOLLOW_PEOPLE`**), **`source-media-ownership`** (**`lookupMediaOwnership`**), **`shared-ownership`** (**`analyzeSharedOwnership`**), **`unnamed-source`** (**`analyzeUnnamedSource`**), **`blindspot`**, **`partiality`**, **`relative-time`**, **`source-digest`**, **`story-topics`** (`HOME_STORY_TOPICS`, **`topicIdForStory`**, **`topicMetaForStory`**, **`storyMatchesTopic`**, **`visibleTopicIdsForStories`**), **`story-share`**, **`story-share-card`** (**`pickSharpestRevealKind`**, **`buildStoryShareCard`**), **`story-share-card-image`**, **`source-perspective`**, **`bangla-date`**, **`seed-source-names`**, **`claim-input`**, **`auth-input`**, **`admin-input`**, **`ingest-schedule`**, **`admin-host`** (`ADMIN_HOST` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_HOST`, production **`admin.khatinews.com`**), **`admin-proxy-client`**, **`admin-route-auth`**, **`admin-users`**, **`admin-user-types`**, **`admin-system-info`**, **`admin-issues`**, `stories`, `demo-data`, `perspectives`, **`reporting-spectrum`** (`reportingToneForArticle`, **`REPORTING_TONE_ORDER`**), `coverage`, **`verifications`**, **`verification-progress`**, **`subscription-plans`** (**`getYearlyPlanSavings`**), **`subscription-features`**, **`subscription-entitlement`**, **`subscription-access`**, **`database.types`**, **`supabase.ts`** barrel + **`supabase/*`**, **`admin-api`**, **`admin-auth`**, **`admin-types`**, **`security-headers`**, **`auth-errors`**
- Resilience UI: `app/error.tsx`, `app/global-error.tsx`, **`app/not-found.tsx`**; segment **`loading.tsx`** on **`story/[slug]`** and **`verify/[slug]`**; **`ApiDegradedBanner`**, **`ClientErrorBoundary`** in `components/`
- Route handlers: `app/api/admin/*` (login, logout, ingest, **`ingest-schedule`**, register, verify, overview, users, sources, **`sources/[id]`** PATCH, **`sources/[id]/import`** multipart, per-source ingest); **`app/api/feed/top`** — `getTopStories`, ETag via **`feed-etag.ts`**; **`app/api/story/[slug]`** — `resolveStoryBySlug` + ETag for **`StoryDetailPanel`**; **`app/api/story/[slug]/share-card`** — session PNG (`hasProAccess`; `Cache-Control: private`, `Vary: Cookie`); **`app/api/me/pro`** — `{ isPro, userId }` from **`getProAccessState()`** (session-safe Pro flag for client components). Server-only; never expose admin/ingest secrets to the browser
- Auth: `app/auth/callback/route.ts`, `app/api/auth/signout/route.ts`
- `frontend/src/middleware.ts` — on **`admin.khatinews.com`** (or `ADMIN_HOST`), rewrites public paths (`/`, `/login`) to internal `/admin/*` and redirects main-site `/admin` to the admin host in production; Supabase session refresh on `/browse`, auth routes, and when `sb-*` cookies exist; legacy cookie **or** Supabase admin for admin UI (except login/register); passes through `/api/admin/*` with security headers only

## Data fetching

- Server components for listings and story pages; prefer **`stories.ts`** helpers over ad hoc `fetchClusters` in pages
- **Home** (`/`): `force-static` **`app/page.tsx`** — **`page-hero-title`** + **`font-bengali`** subcopy; **`HeaderBanglaDate`** with optional **`className`**; **`HomeStoryGridClient`** (**`HomeTopicFilter`**, Pro follow on cards, **`HomeArchiveLink`** → `/browse`); demo slice then **`fetch('/api/feed/top?limit=…')`** + **`/api/me/pro`**. **`HOME_TOP_STORIES_LIMIT`** in **`subscription-features.ts`** (24)
- **Story** (`/story/[slug]`): `revalidate = 60`; `generateStaticParams` from demo; **`generateMetadata`** via **`buildStoryShareOpenGraph`** (square reveal card from **`opengraph-image.tsx`**, not the RSS lead photo); **`loading.tsx`** skeleton; **`StoryDetailPanel`** reads **`client-story-cache`**, then **`fetch('/api/story/{slug}')`** with ETag; 304 keeps cache; `notFound()` when API 404 and no cache
- **Verify detail** (`/verify/[slug]`): **`loading.tsx`** + page-level **`Suspense`** around async **`VerificationDetail`** (`lookupVerifiedClaim`)
- **`stories.ts`**: `storyFromCluster`, **`storyFromClusterDetail`** (maps API **`source_name`** / **`bias_score`** / **`owner_name`** / **`owner_url`** / **`parent_name`** / **`parent_url`** onto articles), **`resolveStoryBySlug`** (cached RSC), **`resolveStoryBySlugDirect`** (API route + OG — no `unstable_cache`), **`getTopStories`**, **`getBrowseClusters`**, **`getRumorsFeed`**, **`getBiasSources`**, **`getLatestArticlesFeed`**, **`getBlindspotStories`** — merge API clusters with `demo-data` by slug; **`deriveTitleBn`** (cluster title or first Bengali article headline via **`mixed-script-text`**; the visible story title is that Bangla line, with the Latin cluster title omitted once Bangla exists) + **`normalizeMixedScriptHeadline`** in **`finalizeStory`**; **`applyBlindspotDetection`** on API-built shells; fall back to **`DEMO_STORIES`** / **`DEMO_RUMOR_ARTICLES`** when the API is down or empty
- **`client-story-cache.ts`**: top list + per-slug story keys; **`storyFingerprint`** includes titles; **`mergeStoryLists`** prefers incoming fields, keeps cached articles when API row is empty; all reads/writes pass through **`client-story-hydrate`**
- **`blindspot.ts`**: **`detectBlindspot`** / **`applyBlindspotDetection`** (≥3 articles; establishment or opposition axis missing while the other side dominates); **`blindspotBannerCopy`** (EN/BN). Used on story detail, feed cards, **`/blindspot`**
- **`source-perspective.ts`**: **`resolveArticlePerspective`**, **`buildSourcePerspectiveLookup`**, **`INTERNATIONAL_SOURCE_NAMES`** (BBC Bangla, DW Bangla, Al Jazeera Bangla, Voice of America Bangla, **Sangbad Pratidin**) — map API bias + known outlet names to **`Perspective`** for **`coverage.ts`** / **`enrichArticles`**
- **`seed-source-names.ts`**: **`SEED_SOURCE_NAMES`** must match `BD_SOURCE_SEED` `name` values (one outlet per row, including Google News fallbacks). **`isCustomRssSource`** is true when the name is absent from that set
- **`coverage.ts`**: **`enrichArticles`**, **`coverageCounts`**, **`coverageStats`** (totals, dominant perspective %, **`lastUpdatedIso`**), **`storyPublishedIso`**, **`dominantBlindspot`** (optional **`SourcePerspectiveLookup`** + per-article **`sourceName`** / **`biasScore`** meta)
- **`partiality.ts`**: **`analyzePartiality`**, **`clusterBiasScore`**, **`partialityBannerCopy`** — surfaces when any perspective bucket is empty (≥2 articles); pair with blindspot banners, do not conflate logic
- **`perspectives.ts`**: **`PERSPECTIVE_META`**, **`spectrumCopy`** / **`spectrumOrder`**. Political stories (`coverageSpectrumModeForStory` in **`story-topics.ts`**) use for government → against government → neutral → international. Other topics use **`reporting-spectrum.ts`** (Clickbait → Mixed → Factual → Rumor) on **`CoverageBar`**, **`StoryArticleFeed`**, and story detail groups
- **`anti-clickbait-summary.ts`**: rule-based strip of sensational EN/BN phrasing; up to 3 bullets per cluster from RSS (no AI)
- **`source-digest.ts`**: **`cleanSourceText`**, **`buildCoverageDigest`**, **`buildPerspectiveDigests`**, **`applySourceDerivedSummaries`** — sets **`Story.summaryBullets`** + inline feed summary via anti-clickbait; perspective tab digests unchanged (wired in **`stories.ts`** before blindspot detection)
- **`story-topics.ts`**: home topic filter ids (`all` \| news \| economy \| politics \| environment \| sports) from **`Story.category`** / **`categoryBn`**; **`visibleTopicIdsForStories`** hides empty chips
- **`followed-stories.ts`**: **`readFollowedStories`**, **`readFollowedStorySlugs`**, **`toggleStoryFollowed`**, **`setStoryFollowed`**, **`FOLLOWED_STORIES_CHANGED_EVENT`** — `localStorage` **`shorup_followed_stories_v2`** (migrates legacy **`shorup_followed_story_slugs_v1`**); Pro-gated UI on home/detail/profile
- **`followed-topics.ts`**: **`readFollowedTopicIds`**, **`toggleTopicFollowed`** — `shorup_followed_topic_ids_v1`; profile **`ProfileFollowSection`** gates with **`custom_topic_radar_alerts`**
- **`follow-people.ts`**: curated **`BD_FOLLOW_PEOPLE`**, **`readFollowedPeopleIds`**, **`togglePersonFollowed`** — `shorup_followed_people_ids_v1`; same Pro gate as topics on profile
- **`reading-history.ts`**: device-local **`StoryReadEntry`** / **`ArticleClickEntry`**; **`recordStoryRead`** from **`StoryDetailPanel`**; **`recordArticleClick`** from **`HeadlinesByPerspective`** when **`readTrackArticleClicksEnabled()`**; powers **`/profile`** bias bar, topic/ownership charts, blindspot insight, saved/recent lists
- **`track-article-clicks-pref.ts`**: opt-in **`shorup_track_article_clicks_v1`** — **`TrackArticleClicksSetting`** on profile (default off)
- **`source-media-ownership.ts`**: **`lookupMediaOwnership`** fallback for seed outlet names; **`mediaOwnershipFromLinks`** prefers cluster **`owner_name`** / **`owner_url`** (and parent) in **`coverage.ts`** **`enrichArticles`**; UI **`SourceOwnershipLine`** on coverage/compare/headline lists
- **`shared-ownership.ts`**: **`analyzeSharedOwnership`** — unique outlets that share an owner or parent name (parent label when that is the link). Null unless one group has ≥2 outlets. **`SharedOwnershipReveal`** on story detail when **`pickSharpestRevealKind`** picks it: free sees the count (`4 outlets, 2 owners`); Pro sees group names. Paywall **`featureId="story_shared_ownership_alerts"`**
- **`unnamed-source.ts`**: **`analyzeUnnamedSource`** — headline or excerpt matches **`সূত্র`** (not সূত্রপাত), **`নাম প্রকাশে অনিচ্ছুক`**, **`সংশ্লিষ্ট`**, or **`sources say`** / **`sources said`**. Null unless ≥2 outlets and at least one hides a name. **`UnnamedSourceReveal`** on story detail when **`pickSharpestRevealKind`** picks it: free sees `4 of 6 outlets attribute this to someone they don't name.`; Pro sees who hid the name and who printed one. Paywall **`featureId="story_unnamed_source"`**. The story page shows only that one reveal
- **`taken-down.ts`**: **`removedAt`** on an article. **`TakenDownVault`** on **`StoryDetailPanel`** (above the title): free sees `Removed from their site at 6:40pm.`; Pro sees the headline and text (`This is what it said at 1:12pm.`). Paywall **`featureId="story_taken_down_vault"`**. Demo slug **`desk-pulled-the-page`** (`TAKEN_DOWN_PREVIEW_SLUG`) shows the wording and is pinned first on the home feed. Removed rows in **`StoryArticleFeed`** do not link out to the dead page. Feed cards show the removal line
- **`walkback-line.ts`**: **`pickClusterWalkback`** — buried sentence starting with তবে / অন্যদিকে / নাম প্রকাশে অনিচ্ছুক একটি সূত্র from RSS excerpts or headlines. **`WalkbackPin`** above the story title; **`WalkbackShareTeaser`** on home cards. Pro **`story-share-card`** leads with this line when present (`story_walkback_line` on **`/pro`**: free + Pro **yes**)
- **`first-headline.ts`**: maps API **`title_history`** / **`social_preview_*`** onto **`Story`**; **`FirstHeadlineCards`** in **`FirstHeadlineCard.tsx`** on detail + home strip; demo **`first-headline-greptar`**. Paywall **`featureId="first_headline"`** for the frozen social preview (free sees both lines + clock)
- **`story-share.ts`**: **`buildStoryShareOpenGraph`** (no lead image in tags), **`pickStoryShareLeadImage`**, **`resolveMetadataBaseOrigin`**, **`buildStoryShareTitle`** (Bangla when a Bangla headline exists) / **`buildStoryShareDescription`**, **`buildStoryShareUrl`**, **`buildSocialShareUrl`** (incl. reddit, email), **`STORY_DETAIL_SHARE_NETWORKS`** (WhatsApp first) vs **`SOCIAL_SHARE_NETWORKS`**, **`buildStoryEmbedSnippet`**, **`buildStoryReportIssueHref`**, **`OG_SHARE_DEFAULT_PATH`** (`public/og-share-default.svg`). **`story-share-card.ts`** **`pickSharpestRevealKind`** / **`buildStoryShareCard`** — one reveal per story; free card is the count (EN + BN); a Pro card leads with the buried walk-back sentence when **`pickClusterWalkback`** finds one, otherwise it adds names or quoted lines; else the khatinews mark. **`story-share-card-image.tsx`** draws the 1080 square PNG with **`frontend/assets/fonts/NotoSansBengali-Regular.ttf`** and **`NotoSansBengali-Bold.ttf`**. Public **`opengraph-image.tsx`** is always the free card. **`GET /api/story/[slug]/share-card`** is the session card every **`StoryShareBar`** network sends when the browser can share a file (otherwise that network’s link); copy-link stays a URL. Uses **`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`**, optional **`NEXT_PUBLIC_REPORT_ISSUES_EMAIL`** / **`NEXT_PUBLIC_REPORT_ISSUES_URL`** (see **`frontend/.env.example`**)
- **`api.ts`**: throws on failure (for callers that want exceptions); feed **`Article`** includes optional **`image_url`**; cluster detail articles include optional **`source_name`** / **`bias_score`** / **`owner_name`** / **`owner_url`** / **`parent_name`** / **`parent_url`**; **`tryApiGet`**, **`tryFetchClusterBySlug`**, **`fetchArticlesFeed`** (optional **`sourceId`**), **`fetchCustomSourcesFeed`** (`/sources?custom_only=true`), **`fetchBiasOverviewFeed`** for optional reads. All GETs use **`fetchJsonSafe`** from **`api-resilience.ts`** (`API_FETCH_TIMEOUT_MS` ≈ 2.5s so SSR fails fast; **`API_WRITE_TIMEOUT_MS`** for POST verify)
- **`/blindspot`**, **`/browse`**: server pages → **`getBlindspotStories`** / **`getBrowseClusters`**; **`StoryFeedCard`** with **`story` only** (no follow props — follow is home + **`StoryDetailPanel`**); **`/blindspot`** shows degraded banner when demo fallback
- **`claim-input.ts`**: client-side **`validateClaimSubmission`** before **`submitVerification`**
- **`verifications.ts`**: GET list/search use safe fetch (empty + **`fromApi: false`** on failure). **`lookupVerifiedClaim`** → `ok` \| `not_found` \| `unavailable` (use on `/verify/[slug]` — do not 500 when the API is offline). **`fetchVerifiedClaimsFeed`** for database page banner. **`submitVerification`** still throws — writes must not fake success
- Show **`ApiDegradedBanner`** (`compact` under titles when `!fromApi`) on home, bias, rumors, browse, verify database; full banner on verify detail when unavailable
- Client components for interactive UI (meters, tabs, modals, mobile nav, PWA install, theme toggle, **`VerifyClaimForm`** job progress via SSE/WebSocket)

## Resilience (crashes + API downtime)

- **Route errors**: `app/error.tsx` (segment reset + Home); `app/global-error.tsx` (root layout failures); **`app/not-found.tsx`** for unknown routes (link home). Error boundaries call **`reloadOnceOnChunkError`** for webpack `ChunkLoadError` (stale PWA cache after deploy — see `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`). Root **`layout.tsx`** injects **`DEV_UNREGISTER_STALE_SERVICE_WORKER_SCRIPT`** in development only. **`error.tsx`** / **`global-error.tsx`** report to Sentry when DSN is set
- **Client islands**: wrap risky client trees in **`ClientErrorBoundary`** (e.g. **`StoryTabs`**, **`VerifyClaimForm`**, **`ClaimSearch`**, auth/admin forms, **`AdminIngestPanel`**, **`AdminSourcesPanel`**) so nav/header keep working
- **Reads**: degrade to demo/cached content + banner; **writes** (verify submit, admin, ingest) show real errors
- New listing/detail pages: extend `stories.ts` / `verifications.ts` rather than raw `fetch` in `page.tsx`

## Admin ops (internal)

- **Legacy**: **`ADMIN_USERNAME`** (default `kiron` in dev) + **`ADMIN_PASSWORD`** + optional **`ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET`** → HMAC cookie `shorup_admin`
- **Supabase admin**: **`ADMIN_EMAILS`** allowlist and/or `app_metadata.role === "admin"`; `GET /api/admin/verify` confirms access for Supabase sign-in on `/admin/login`
- **Bootstrap**: **`ADMIN_REGISTRATION_CODE`** + **`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`** for `POST /api/admin/register` and `/admin/register`
- **Page vs API auth**: middleware + **`/admin` page** use **`isAdminRouteAuthorized`** (legacy **or** Supabase admin). **`GET /api/admin/overview`** uses the same gate and returns **`{ overview, apiHealthy }`**. **Sources (incl. PATCH + file import), ingest, `/api/admin/ingest-schedule`, and `/api/admin/users*`** still require **`verifyAdminSession`** (legacy cookie only) — mutating route handlers use **`requireAdminRouteAuthorized()`** in **`admin-route-auth.ts`** for a 401 JSON response
- **`/admin` page** (`force-dynamic`): SSR **`fetchAdminOverview`** + **`fetchApiHealth`**, **`buildAdminSystemInfo`**, then **`AdminDashboardPanel`** with tabs — **Overview**, **General** (sources + ingest), **System**, **Users**, **Issues** (`collectAdminIssues`). Client refetch via **`GET /api/admin/overview`**; listens for **`shorup:admin-refresh`** (from **`AdminIngestPanel`** / **`AdminSourcesPanel`**)
- **`AdminUsersPanel`**: **`getAdminRoute` / `postAdminRoute` / `patchAdminRoute` / `deleteAdminRoute`** → `/api/admin/users` — list auth users + profiles + subscription tier; create user; set **free/Pro** (`subscriptions` upsert via service role); delete user. Requires **`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`** on the Next server
- **`ADMIN_API_KEY`** must match backend when set — `admin-api.ts` sends `X-Admin-Key` for overview and source CRUD
- **`INGEST_API_KEY`** forwarded as `X-Ingest-Key` from `AdminIngestPanel` via `POST /api/admin/ingest` (polls async ingest jobs when API returns 202); **ingest interval** via **`PATCH /api/admin/ingest-schedule`** (`fetchAdminIngestSchedule` / `updateAdminIngestSchedule` in **`admin-api.ts`**); UI copy/helpers in **`ingest-schedule.ts`** (`formatIngestScheduleHint`, `nextIngestPullEstimate`)
- **`AdminSourcesPanel`**: add **live RSS** vs **file** mode (`admin-input.ts` — **`FILE_IMPORT_PLACEHOLDER_HOST`**, **`buildFileSourceCreatePayload`**, validate URLs); create + optional immediate file upload; per-row **Upload file** → **`postAdminFormRoute`** → **`POST /api/admin/sources/[id]/import`**; **Set live RSS** → **`patchAdminRoute`** + **`updateAdminSource`** (`ingest_mode` → **`rss`**); active vs **disabled** feeds; **Pull now** → `POST /api/admin/sources/[id]/ingest` (RSS mode only); remove → `DELETE /api/admin/sources/[id]` (**purges** feed articles + orphan clusters, then soft-disable seed or delete custom row); re-add same name to re-enable; dispatches **`shorup:admin-refresh`** on changes
- **`admin-api.ts`**: **`importAdminSourceFile`**, **`updateAdminSource`** (PATCH); **`admin-types.ts`** — **`SourceIngestMode`**, **`ingest_mode`** on **`AdminSourceStat`**
- Prefer extending `admin-api.ts` / `admin-types.ts` / `admin-users.ts` for new ops endpoints; keep credentials out of client bundles

## Auth, Pro & gating

- Supabase: **`createBrowserSupabaseClient`** (`supabase/client.ts`) for client components; **`createServerSupabaseClient`** (`supabase/server.ts`) in RSC and route handlers; **`createServiceRoleSupabaseClient`** (`supabase/service.ts`) for admin register (service role). Barrel: `lib/supabase.ts`
- Sign-in / sign-up under `/sign-in`, `/sign-up` — **`auth-input.ts`**, **`safeAuthRedirectPath`**; **`SignInForm`** footer upsells **`/pro`** (not sign-up); sign-up page stays minimal copy
- Admin browser calls use **`admin-proxy-client.ts`** (`getAdminRoute`, `postAdminRoute`, **`postAdminFormRoute`** multipart, `patchAdminRoute`, `deleteAdminRoute`, **`ADMIN_INGEST_CLIENT_TIMEOUT_MS`**) + **`admin-input.ts`** for RSS vs file source forms
- **Free vs Pro matrix**: `subscription-features.ts` — **`PRO_ONLY_FEATURE_IDS`**: **`follow_story`**, **`track_article_clicks`**, **`story_shared_ownership_alerts`**, **`story_unnamed_source`**, **`story_taken_down_vault`**, **`first_headline`**, **`custom_topic_radar_alerts`**; **`getFeatureRow`** for **`PaywallModal`**
- **Entitlement check**: `subscription-access.ts` — **`getProAccessState()`** / **`hasProAccess()`** (Supabase `subscriptions` + **`NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_PRO`**); expose to browser via **`GET /api/me/pro`** only — do not import service role in client components
- **Follow story**: **`StoryFollowButton`** on detail + feed cards; non-Pro → **`PaywallModal`**; Pro → **`followed-stories.ts`**
- **Browse** (`/browse`): open to all users — cluster grid + latest articles via **`getBrowseClusters`** / **`getLatestArticlesFeed`**
- **Plans** (`/pro`, client): **`SubscriptionPlanCards`** — matrix rows from **`SUBSCRIPTION_FEATURE_MATRIX`** (free **`yes`** incl. **`anti_clickbait_summary`**; ids in **`PRO_ONLY_FEATURE_IDS`** show **locked** on free); yearly **Save …** badge via **`getYearlyPlanSavings`** (replaces static plan **`badge`**). **`FeatureMatrixTable`** under the cards (Feature / Free / Pro, including **`story_unnamed_source`**: free count, Pro names; **`story_taken_down_vault`**: free removal line, Pro original headline and text; **`story_walkback_line`**: free sees the buried sentence above the headline, Pro uses that sentence as the share-card line; **`first_headline`**: free sees both lines and the clock, Pro sees the social preview frozen when the story appeared). The WhatsApp story share card stays a product feature and is omitted from this matrix
- **`PaywallModal`**: checkout stub; **`featureId: ProOnlyFeatureId`**; dialog a11y (Escape, backdrop click, body scroll lock); on **`/pro`** CTAs defer to page plans; lists monthly, yearly, and **day pass** (৳15 / 24h, one-time); yearly plan highlighted + savings via **`getYearlyPlanSavings`** + **`formatPlanPrice`** / **`formatPlanPriceSuffix`**; copy uses **`PRO_TIER_TAGLINE`** from **`subscription-features.ts`**
- Pricing: `subscription-plans.ts`; PayEurasia env in `frontend/.env.example` (server-only when integrated)
- **`AuthNav`**: signed-out **Go Pro** (`/pro`) + chevron menu (Sign in); signed-in email menu → **Profile**, Blindspot, Browse, Rumors, Verify, Bias, Sign out — **`SiteHeader`** no longer lists Pro separately
- **`/profile`**: RSC page — **`getProAccessState()`** for **`displayName`** + Pro flag; client **`MyNewsBiasDashboard`** (**Mine** vs **Demo** tabs, **`ClientErrorBoundary`**) — bias bar, **`StoriesReadChart`**, topic/ownership sections, **`BlindspotReadingInsight`**, **`ProfileFollowSection`**, **`ProfileSavedNewsSection`**, **`TrackArticleClicksSetting`**, **`ProfileProUpsell`**; no backend sync yet (localStorage + demo stats **`DEMO_MY_NEWS_BIAS_STATS`**)

## PWA

- `@ducanh2912/next-pwa` in `next.config.ts` (wrapped with `withSentryConfig`); service worker and install prompt in **production** builds only
- Offline shell: `/offline`; `InstallPWA` in root layout
- Generated PWA assets under `frontend/public/` (e.g. `sw.js`, `workbox-*.js`) and **`frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo`** — build outputs only; do not hand-edit or commit; rebuild after PWA config changes

## Error monitoring (optional)

- `@sentry/nextjs` — `instrumentation.ts` loads `sentry.server.config` / `sentry.edge.config`; browser SDK in `instrumentation-client.ts` at `frontend/` root
- Captures: `app/error.tsx`, `app/global-error.tsx`, **`ClientErrorBoundary`** (`componentDidCatch`)
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE`; CI map upload via `SENTRY_ORG`, `SENTRY_PROJECT`, `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN` (see `frontend/.env.example`)
- Omit DSN locally — Sentry stays disabled with no runtime cost

## Types

- API shapes: exported from `lib/api.ts`
- Verification: `VerifiedClaim`, `VerifiedClaimLookup`, job event types from `lib/verifications.ts`
- Rich story UI: `Story`, `NewsSource` from `lib/demo-data.ts`
- Supabase: `lib/database.types.ts` — align with `supabase/migrations/`
- Do not duplicate types across components; import from `lib/`

## UI notes

- **Theme**: `next-themes`; **`globals.css`** — light remaps for dark-first utilities; **`.dark`** soft charcoal **`--color-ink-950/900/700`**, sky **`--color-accent`** (links + buttons), explicit **`.dark .text-zinc-*`** / **`.page-title*`** / **`.page-hero-title`** contrast; **`bg-accent`** labels white (light) / black (dark). **`.story-title-bn`** — Noto Bengali, strict line breaks (feed + detail titles; **`page-title-lg.story-title-bn`** on story detail). Trust tokens over ad hoc gray hex when adding surfaces
- **`HeaderBanglaDate`**: client **`formatBanglaHeaderDate`**; use on home hero (or pass **`className`**) — not in **`SiteHeader`**
- **`SiteHeader`**: sticky bar; subtitle copy under logo (English product line)
- Keep BN strings alongside EN where the product already does; home hero and many labels lead with Bangla
- **`MobileNav`** (md:hidden): Blindspot, Browse, Bias — not every public route
- Product components: **`SourceOwnershipLine`**, **`ArticleImage`**, **`StoryFeedCard`** — **`variant="home"`** (compact card: BN meta line with inline blindspot/partiality hints, **`titleBn`** only, 2-line summary from bullets; default variant uses the same Bangla story title via **`storySubtitle`**, plus bullet list + **`BlindspotBanner`** + **`StoryPartialityTeaser`**); **`CoverageBar`**, optional **`StoryFollowButton`**. **`HomeStoryGridClient`** passes **`variant="home"`**. **`HomeTopicFilter`**, **`StoryDetailPanel`** (Bangla story title, each article headline in its original language, **`StoryDetailMetaBar`**, **`AntiClickbaitSummaryPanel`**, the sharper of **`SharedOwnershipReveal`** / **`UnnamedSourceReveal`**, **`StoryCoverageBlock`**, partiality/blindspot banners), **`StoryShareBar`** (**`variant="detail"`** on detail — embed copy + extended networks), **`StoryTabs`** + tab **`SourceDigestPanel`**, **`StoryCoverageDetails`** (**`density="compact"`** inside **`StoryCoverageBlock`**), **`SubscriptionPlanCards`**, **`PaywallModal`**, **`AuthNav`**, admin/auth forms — see `components/` tree
